 "titulo": "Footprints came to our door. None went back ❄️ Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "NONE WENT BACK",
 "descripcion": "Sam and Jess are snowed in at an old Montana farmhouse for five days. One morning, boot prints come out of the forest to their back door. None go back.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you check the attic?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine waking up to *footprints* that walk to your back door, and none that walk away.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Sam and Jess just bought an old farmhouse in Montana.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Cheap, quiet, two miles from the nearest neighbor.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In their first week, a blizzard closes the road for *five days*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "No plows, no mail, just snow up to the windows.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "On the third morning, Sam goes out for firewood.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "There's a line of boot prints coming out of the forest.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Big boots, deep steps, straight to their back door.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because Sam checked the snow all around the house.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "There are no prints going back. Not one.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Inside, Jess checks the hook where they keep the spare key.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The *spare key* is gone.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "They search every room. Closets, basement, under the beds. Nothing.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Sam says it must be a hunter who got lost, and left.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "That night, at 2:10 AM, Jess shakes him awake.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Above the bedroom ceiling, someone is walking. *Slow, heavy steps*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "But this house has no stairs to the attic. Only a sealed hatch.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "And the hatch is open. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
